    <briefdescription>
<para>Associates a texture with an entity for 2D rendering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Entities with this component will be rendered as a sprite using the assigned texture. The <ref refid="classRenderSystem" kindref="compound">RenderSystem</ref> reads this component along with <ref refid="structComponents_1_1Transform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref> to draw the entity.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The texture is stored as a shared_ptr, allowing multiple entities to share the same texture (efficient for tilemaps or repeated sprites). </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structComponents_1_1Transform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref>, <ref refid="classRenderSystem" kindref="compound">RenderSystem</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
